idence/P11/native-attempt-09-vm/captures/c49-custom-destination-card.png\",\n    \"docs/planning/evidence/P11/native-attempt-09-vm/captures/c49-add-required-oauth-draft.png\"\n  ],\n  \"recommendation\": \"pass\"\n}import { describe, expect, it } from 'vitest'\nimport tokens from '../styles/tokens.css?raw'\n\nfunction declarations(selector: string): Record<string, string> {\n    const start = tokens.indexOf(`${selector} {`)\n    if (start < 0) throw new Error(`Missing palette: ${selector}`)\n    const body = tokens.slice(start, tokens.indexOf('}', start))\n    return Object.fromEntries([...body.matchAll(/--v2-([\\w-]+): (#[\\da-f]{6});/g)].map((m) => [m[1]!, m[2]!]))\n}\n\nconst luminance = (hex: string) => {\n    const values = [1, 3, 5].map((at) => parseInt(hex.slice(at, at + 2), 16) / 255).map((c) => c <= 0.04045 ? c / 12.92 : ((c + 0.055) / 1.055) ** 2.4)\n    return values[0]! * 0.2126 + values[1]! * 0.7152 + values[2]! * 0.0722\n}\nconst contrast = (a: string, b: string) => {\n    const [low, high] = [luminance(a), luminance(b)].sort((x, y) => x - y)\n    return (high! + 0.05) / (low! + 0.05)\n}\n\ndescribe.each(['prismaAirs', 'gruvbox'])('%s palette contrast', (family) => {\n    it.each(['light', 'dark'])('%s retains readable text and visible controls', (appearance) => {\n        const palette = {\n            ...declarations(':root'),\n            ...(appearance === 'dark' ? declarations(\":root[data-appearance='dark']\") : {}),\n            ...(family === 'gruvbox' ? declarations(`:root[data-color-theme='gruvbox'][data-appearance='${appearance}']`) : {}),\n        }\n        for (const surface of ['bg', 'paper', 'inset']) {\n            for (const ink of ['ink', 'soft', 'faint']) expect(contrast(palette[ink]!, palette[surface]!), `${ink} on ${surface}`).toBeGreaterThanOrEqual(4.5)\n            for (const control of ['ctl', 'acc']) expect(contrast(palette[control]!, palette[surface]!), `${control} on ${surface}`).toBeGreaterThanOrEqual(3)\n        }\n        expect(contrast(palette['acc-ink']!, palette.acc!)).toBeGreaterThanOrEqual(4.5)\n        for (const status of ['block', 'flag', 'ok']) expect(contrast(palette[status]!, palette[`${status}-bg`]!)).toBeGreaterThanOrEqual(4.5)\n    })\n})\ndocs/architecture/checks.json:758:          \"src/v2/settings/management-credential.test.tsx\",\ndocs/architecture/checks.json:3668:          \"src/v2/settings/setup-warning-history.test.tsx\"\ndocs/architecture/checks.json:3679:          \"src/v2/settings/management-credential.test.tsx\"\ndocs/architecture/checks.json:3986:    \"C49\": {\ndocs/architecture/checks.json:4045:        \"C49\",\ndocs/architecture/checks.json:4051:      \"native_acceptance\": \"D063: C49 changed-flow assertions in native-checks.json on the current prepared candidate; preserve historical raw bindings and explicitly document unchanged-impact carry. No retired gate replay.\",\ndocs/architecture/checks.json:4066:          \"src/v2/settings/refinement-settings.test.tsx\",\ndocs/architecture/checks.json:4081:          \"src/v2/settings/management-credential.test.tsx\"\ndocs/architecture/checks.json:4178:      \"C49\"\ndocs/architecture/native-checks.json:45:        \"check\": \"Zoom/large text: View zoom in to 150% and 200% (Cmd+=) keeps navigation, headings and settings readable and operable; Cmd+0 restores.\"\ndocs/architecture/native-checks.json:399:        \"check\": \"A profile's details show its fields and say directional and customized prompt-injection settings were local previews and are not sent; an API key's details show its unknown status value 'FUTURE_STATUS' and last8 while none of the service's secret field values (api_key, auth_code) appear anywhere in the window; deployment profiles (local paging, 1\\u20133 of 3) and DLP data patterns (Spring paging, 1\\u20131 of 2) are listed.\"\ndocs/architecture/native-checks.json:783:        \"check\": \"The Workspace tab shows the chosen workspace's own settings with its defaults and embedded limits; Refresh workspace is reached and pressed by keyboard and keeps focus; choosing another workspace shows only that workspace's settings.\"\ndocs/architecture/native-checks.json:1275:        \"check\": \"Overlays as the prototype draws them: the tenant button opens the 360px tenant menu naming the tenant with its environment and TSG, Tenant settings and credentials\\u2026, Change Gateway workspace\\u2026, the tenant rows under Switch tenant with \\u2303n hints and the current one checked, and Add a tenant; Escape closes it and returns focus to the button; the header's search button opens the 640px palette with its search row, grouped rows (Go to, Tenants, Actions) with \\u2318 hints and the key-hint footer; typing narrows the rows and Enter navigates; Escape closes it.\"\ndocs/architecture/native-checks.json:1327:        \"check\": \"The other products on the card pattern (C39b): AI Gateway with the workspace Team A chosen \\u2014 the Workspaces tab's chooser and the chosen workspace's settings read with its admitted Edit\\u2026 / Archive\\u2026, the Routes tab as a table with search, New route\\u2026 and a detail whose actions are the inventory's, the Keys tab with the service / user kinds; AI Red Teaming \\u2014 the Overview's summary tiles and ranked bars, the Targets table with Results per target (identifiers only), the Scans tab's list without the tiles; Model and skill scans \\u2014 the Model scans table (or the plane's 'none read') and Codebase scans not available in this release. Every table is read through the management client and says its coverage.\"\ndocs/architecture/native-checks.json:1387:        \"check\": \"Prepared real fixture is Prisma AIRS Desktop Fixture1.0.0, identifierio.cdot.airs-desktop.fixture, binaryprisma-airs-desktop. Production config independently names Prisma AIRS Desktop1.0.0/io.cdot.airs-desktop. Native About/menu/title and Home-first catalogue agree; startup/settings/sessions focus and headings use the one presentation. Exact candidate process identity, executable and complete bundle are bound.\"\ndocs/architecture/native-checks.json:1440:    \"C49\": [\ndocs/architecture/native-checks.json:1442:        \"id\": \"C49-N01\",\ndocs/architecture/native-checks.json:1446:        \"id\": \"C49-N02\",\ndocs/architecture/native-checks.json:1450:        \"id\": \"C49-N03\",\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
